Package: autoMLR
Type: Package
Title: Interactive AutoML Data Cleaning Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("autoMLR", "Team", email = "automlr@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides a Shiny dashboard and reusable transformation pipeline
    for interactive data cleaning. The package demonstrates defensive
    programming, an R6 pipeline class, Rcpp helpers, vectorised data
    transformations, and package-level roxygen2 documentation.
